							<Section Name="User Variables" TypeGUID="0244C2CA-486B-E148-C1E2-82323B844A49" Identifier="31265d3d-d639-422c-9573-2e18aaa81e3d">
								<Description>A NI-9144 EtherCAT chassis can run a custom FPGA personality created with LabVIEW FPGA. After downloading the FPGA personality to the NI-9144 chassis, use this page to import the user variables of the custom personality to NI VeriStand.

User variable types supported include:
U32, U16, U8, I32, I16, I8, Boolean, and FXP.

Note: The only supported FXP UDVs are those  with word lengths up to 32 bits, and integer word lengths between -32 and +32.</Description>
								<Properties>
									<Property Name="user.CD.Bitfile Path - Host">
										<String />
									</Property>
									<Property Name="user.CD.FPGA Target">
										<BinaryString />
									</Property>
									<Property Name="user.CD.FPGA Sig">
										<BinaryString />
									</Property>
									<Property Name="user.CD.Bitfile Path - Target">
										<String />
									</Property>
								</Properties>
								<Errors />
							</Section>
						</Section>
					</Section>
